### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Test Multi-Language Translation (Hindi)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/translate/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Clean water supply issue reported in Ranchi",
  "targetLang": "Hindi"
}

###

### 3. Test Batch Translation
POST http://localhost:5000/api/translate/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "texts": [
    "Clean water supply issue reported in Ranchi",
    "Potholes on main road near railway station"
  ],
  "targetLang": "Hindi"
}

###

### 4. User Registration (Citizen)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "citizen_test@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "confirmPassword": "Password@123",
  "role": "INDIVIDUAL_CITIZEN",
  "profileDetails": {
    "fullName": "Rohan Kumar",
    "district": "Ranchi",
    "state": "Delhi",
    "pincode": "834001"
  }
}

###

### 5. User Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "citizen_test@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

### 6. FCM Push Notification Diagnostic Status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notifications/fcm-status
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Android AssetLinks Route
GET http://localhost:5000/.well-known/assetlinks.json
Accept: application/json
